{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝日新聞DIGITALの\n乃木坂Choiceのコーナーで\n中田の順番が回ってきたのです！\n見てね(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日『Rの法則』の放送だったんだよ！\n告知遅れました(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\n今日の24時〜24時30分に\n再放送あるから\n見逃しちゃったかたは見てね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/30/3163014/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もプリンシパルの練習だったよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近毎日\nプリンシパル関連以外は\nご飯食べるか\nお風呂はいるか\nブログ書くことくらいしかしてないので\n書く内容が薄いのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じの日々ですよーっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ、また！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/30/3163014/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Samurai ELOの撮影のときの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レジ初さわり記念写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}